  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nMean of the series = 12.58 \n\n \n \n\n x:\n 5\n 8\n 10\n 12\n p\n 20\n 25\n \n \n\n f:\n 2\n 5\n 8\n 22\n 7\n 4\n 2\n \n \n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBy direct method\n\nMean = ∑ fx/N \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n \n \n\n x\n 5\n 8\n 10\n 12\n p\n 20\n 25\n \n \n\n f\n 2\n 5\n 8\n 22\n 7\n 4\n 2\n \n \n\n fx\n 10\n 40\n 80\n 264\n 7p\n 80\n 50\n \n \n\nN = ∑f = 50\n\n∑ fx = 524 + 7p\n\n12.58 = (524 + 7p)/50\n\n⇒ 12.58 × 50 = 524 + 7p \n\n⇒ 629 - 524 = 7p \n\n⇒ p = 105/7 \n\n**∴ p = 15**",
